import{_ as i,o as t,c as n,a2 as a}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const m=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 302 | Shrouding-the-Heavens Decomposition | Critique of Human Centeredness: Racial Limitation on Evolution Qualification","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 302 | Shrouding-the-Heavens Decomposition | Critique of Human Centeredness: Racial Limitation on Evolution Qualification","no":302,"module":2,"tags":["Shrouding the Heavens","Human Centeredness","Racial Limitation","Evolution Qualification","Oligarchic Civilization"],"related":["05-Myriad Races Common Progress Basic Program","51-Humanity Position and Traits","53-Strange-Life Recognition Standards"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0302_模块2-遮天-人族本位批判.md","filePath":"en/0302_模块2-遮天-人族本位批判.md"}'),o={name:"en/0302_模块2-遮天-人族本位批判.md"};function s(r,e,l,u,c,d){return t(),n("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[a('<h1 id="entry-302-shrouding-the-heavens-decomposition-critique-of-human-centeredness-racial-limitation-on-evolution-qualification" tabindex="-1">Entry 302 | Shrouding-the-Heavens Decomposition | Critique of Human Centeredness: Racial Limitation on Evolution Qualification <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-302-shrouding-the-heavens-decomposition-critique-of-human-centeredness-racial-limitation-on-evolution-qualification" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 302 | Shrouding-the-Heavens Decomposition | Critique of Human Centeredness: Racial Limitation on Evolution Qualification&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 2 · Myriad-Realms Benchmark Critique Library | Series: Full Decomposition of the Shrouding-the-Heavens System (Entry 15) | Benchmark base: Documents 05, 51, 53</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-on-what-grounds-is-humanity-defaulted-as-protagonist" tabindex="-1">Introduction: On what grounds is &quot;humanity&quot; defaulted as protagonist <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-on-what-grounds-is-humanity-defaulted-as-protagonist" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: On what grounds is &quot;humanity&quot; defaulted as protagonist&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Among the six top-level axioms, the republican axiom of Myriad Races expressly states &quot;all beings have equal evolution qualification.&quot; This entry further builds on the demon-race entry (301): Shrouding-the-Heavens world setting &quot;humanity&quot; as default protagonist race is itself an unexamined privilege. The law-first axiom requires: the world-view cannot write &quot;who deserves to cultivate&quot; as a racial question. Protagonist uniqueness dependency = medium (oligarchic civilization). The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s evaluation base has been upgraded to six top-level axioms.</p><h2 id="i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" tabindex="-1">I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Human-centeredness energy waste:</p><ul><li>Human cultivation system gets all narrative and resource tilt; other races&#39; possibilities systematically omitted</li><li>Non-human geniuses even with outstanding aptitude are narratively downgraded to &quot;foreign prodigies,&quot; screen time and resources disproportionate</li><li>Different races&#39; evolution paths that could have complemented each other cannot unfold due to &quot;human supremacy&quot;</li></ul><h2 id="ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" tabindex="-1">II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Racial-centeredness regression consequences:</p><ol><li><strong>Qualification discrimination</strong>: world-view defaults &quot;humanity is the orthodox cultivator,&quot; other races&#39; cultivation seen as &quot;heterodox&quot;</li><li><strong>Boundary closure</strong>: lack of knowledge flow between humanity and foreign races, each internal-frictions in closed systems</li><li><strong>Diversity lost</strong>: single perspective dominates narrative; civilization loses diverse wisdom Myriad Ranks could have contributed</li></ol><h2 id="iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" tabindex="-1">III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Ye Fan&#39;s human-centeredness is the racial-upgraded version of predatory thinking:</p><ul><li><strong>Human-centered narrative</strong>: Ye Fan&#39;s growth = humanity&#39;s growth; other races are only backdrop in this process</li><li><strong>&quot;For our humanity&quot; moral packaging</strong>: guarding humanity is endowed with moral legitimacy, but never asks whether foreign races also have equal right to &quot;guard their own race&quot;</li><li><strong>Qualification monopoly</strong>: humanity explains the highest Great Dao as &quot;humanity&#39;s legacy,&quot; equivalent to distributing cosmos-tier evolution rights by race</li></ul><p>Human centeredness also has a narrative convenience: it lets readers naturally identify with the protagonist, lowering creative cost. The author need not bother explaining &quot;why this race deserves sympathy,&quot; because readers default the human protagonist is just. But this convenience has a price — it deprives the author of the chance to practice &quot;understanding the world from the other&#39;s perspective.&quot; Shrouding-the-Heavens&#39; cosmology expands larger and larger, but never walks out of the human perspective; this is precisely the convenience&#39;s price. Heng Yuan Zhou requiring each race to have a complete path, each perspective an independent narrative, is not for political correctness, but to make the world-view truly cosmos-scale — a cosmos with only human perspective, however large, is still one village.</p><h2 id="iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" tabindex="-1">IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative&quot;">​</a></h2><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Shrouding&#39;s Human Centeredness</th><th>Anchor Symbiosis Alternative</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Humanity as default protagonist race</td><td>Myriad Races five genealogies equal, no human privilege</td></tr><tr><td>Foreign-race cultivation as heterodox</td><td>Myriad Races&#39; differentiated paths, each has an orthodox road</td></tr><tr><td>Human-centered narrative</td><td>Myriad Ranks co-build narrative, plural perspectives</td></tr><tr><td>Evolution qualification distributed by race</td><td>Everyone-Has-a-Road Guarantee System, regardless of race</td></tr><tr><td>Foreign races as backdrop</td><td>Myriad Ranks 99% full coverage, each race has complete path</td></tr></tbody></table><h2 id="v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" tabindex="-1">V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan&quot;">​</a></h2><ol><li><strong>Modeling</strong>: replicate Shrouding-the-Heavens world&#39;s &quot;humanity / foreign race&quot; resource allocation ratio</li><li><strong>Variables</strong>: inject &quot;Myriad Races equal constitutionalized&quot; vs. &quot;maintain human centeredness&quot;</li><li><strong>Observation</strong>: foreign-race success rate, civilization total-energy diversity</li><li><strong>Review</strong>: conclusion — under human centeredness, foreign-race talent utilization under 30%; after equality civilization total energy and innovation rise significantly</li></ol><h2 id="vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" tabindex="-1">VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Setting self-consistency: medium-low</strong>. Why humanity is &quot;naturally&quot; protagonist, the world-view gives no strong explanation, entirely by narrative inertia</li><li><strong>Retcon-ending risk: medium</strong>. Foreign-race forces&#39; strength fluctuates with plot need</li><li><strong>Protagonist uniqueness dependency: medium</strong>. Ye Fan&#39;s protagonist status rests on the premise of &quot;humanity protagonist&quot;</li></ul><p>Human centeredness also has a logical hole: in Shrouding-the-Heavens cosmos, on what grounds is humanity protagonist? The world-view&#39;s answer is &quot;humanity adapts well&quot; or &quot;humanity produced Ye Fan.&quot; But this is precisely circular reasoning — because humanity produced Ye Fan, humanity is important; because humanity is important, Ye Fan&#39;s story is worth telling. Heng Yuan Zhou does not accept this circularity. It requires each race&#39;s importance not to depend on &quot;whether it produced a protagonist,&quot; but on that race&#39;s inherent qualification as a civilization member. Qualification precedes achievement.</p><p><strong>Old-new cosmos resource comparison</strong>: old-cosmos resources and Great Dao are finite, inevitably predatory involution; Anchor Symbiosis has everyone inherently possessing infinite origin, predation loses meaning.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: foreign-race talent wasted, knowledge flow closed</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: distributing evolution qualification by race is cosmos-tier discrimination</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang-Luo world internally only humanity, but does not explicitly discriminate against outer races; Shrouding writes human centeredness into narrative skeleton</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: this entry directly targets the Myriad-Races axiom — humanity enjoys no evolution privilege</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: race-centered cosmos cannot face true plural civilizations</li></ul><p>Human centeredness also produces a moral superiority: humanity naturally stands on the just side, the demon race naturally on the dangerous side. This binary division makes Shrouding-the-Heavens world&#39;s moral judgment extremely simple — whoever attacks humanity is villain; the demon attacking humans is evil. But in a truly complex moral world, good and evil do not depend on race, but on action. Heng Yuan Zhou judges good and evil by action, not by race; this is civilization progress from &quot;racial morality&quot; to &quot;behavioral morality.&quot;</p><ul><li><strong>Universal equal infinite law</strong>: basic infinite power is inherent in all; the easygoing retain a guarantee, strivers can superimpose higher; infinite origin erases predatory motivation, predatory involution loses meaning from the root</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Human centeredness is not Shrouding-the-Heavens&#39; &quot;perspective choice,&quot; but proof it cannot imagine a &quot;non-human protagonist.&quot; Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s proposition: Great Dao does not divide races, qualification does not ask birth.</p><p>Human centeredness is not Shrouding-the-Heavens&#39; perspective choice, but the boundary of its imagination. Heng Yuan Zhou requires the author to walk out this boundary, not for political correctness, but to make the world-view truly deserve the word &quot;cosmos.&quot;</p><p>In the final analysis, Shrouding-the-Heavens · human-centered critique described in this document is no isolated case — its causality and energy-level traces are filed throughout in the Alaya Network, traceable and verifiable.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./301_模块2-遮天-妖族处境.html">Entry 301 · Demon-Race Situation</a> · <a href="./313_模块2-遮天-万族共和方案.html">Entry 313 · Myriad Races Republican Plan</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/51-人族定位与特质.html">51-Humanity Position and Traits</a></li></ul>',32)])])}const g=i(o,[["render",s]]);export{m as __pageData,g as default};
